+- Freezing a project (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`) is a manager-only write: other roles get 403. It changes every member's role to `viewer` and clears the assignee of every task in the project (an assignee must be a contributor or manager). A frozen project rejects task writes for everyone with 403, since nobody has a writer role there any more. Freezing is not undone by the API. It is a write, so an archived project gets 409.
